                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Cute little puzzle platformer that gives just enough of a challenge to keep it interesting without ever really getting all that hard. The mechanics are fun, and there are some standard \"extra\" goals to shoot for beyond the basic level clear.\r\n\r\nI think I would have enjoyed it a bit more if falling into pits/lava a tad bit less punishing. Also it was unclear to me how I was meant to tackle some of the bosses; a little too much trial and error there.\r\n\r\nOverall this is a good one to pick up for $3-4 on sale. I got about 10 good hours with 100% achievements.",
